  "photo-caption": "<p>Hey there!<br/></p><p>Just a heads up from us: We’re still alive, but the lab is in a bit of corona-related hibernation. Current restrictions mean our physical space has to be closed to everyone, even our members. We’re trying to organize some virtual events, some of our regular meetups have moved to virtual formats, and we’re kicking off a new <a href=\"https://www.meetup.com/de-DE/The-Hacking-Room-Project-Munich/events/276368671/\">electronics meetup next week</a>. You can check out <a href=\"https://munichmakerlab.de/calendar.html\">our calendar</a> for all the events.</p><p>In the meantime, here’s a sneak peek at our attempt to create a 3D scan of the space for all of you who miss us so dearly. Well, let’s just say we’re not quite there yet 😅<br/></p>",
